#  RGBCOLS.DEF
#  System file for :
#  Ortep-3 for Windows Version 2.0 (April 2008)
#
# This file provides the RGB-triplet colour definitions and is only used
# to MODIFY or ADD colours. 126 colours are defined internally.
#
# If a colour name in this file corresponds to an internally defined colour
# (see Table 2 of documentation) then the RGB colour table will be modified.
#
# If a colour name does not correspond to an internally defined colour, that
# colour will be added to the end of the colour list.
#
# NOTE a maximum of 20 characters are allowed for extra colour names, and
#      white spaces must separate each field on a line
#
# Colour name            RED      GREEN     BLUE
Purple                0.627451  0.125490  0.941176
DeepPink              1.000000  0.078341  0.576471
Lightblue             0.560784  0.560784  1.000000
PowderBlue            0.690196  0.878431  0.901961
